{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0f58c3108d6f384697d1b28aacfa010beeace5d14b0fcad5dc6eed9cab365f7016c2aaf9aa765c27c621dbdedb4499eeda54211fc028e8bc57cf5496c5cad143\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a9e4e9c57f7e275393ac436f31c8b5535556807a5c318bb767a55872167b086727438bb8a01804f56b0cf3a4f0afc7d76341d1e2644f90860c55d0917984083501139838b88b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/67a138ef4162cca7b760d1b55a94d601862569fcca9bd3a0ac72ce03497065e8dff3e8bbab706551dd583e6c4f538619c72216aa5a5dfaa3eedc4c655ea7f8d060b687b839f90fe73266e1b93a7ee27b582c006c120f41458f123ce14c77c5651b38bd67c8147fc3a70f50fe90974239db13234f3b862062\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/62babc1fb9100d5110e13690c7c051dd48feaf54ce985646f27acf9e424050c5a2f38201ed1f669f60fdaa5808dc485aa18906936b995c1322cd2318d37ad47e9df2cb5002845182ded61e738bc4b8377753b3fa1266ba60dfedd5b461c76bac287b860a7d4012c05443b7982fcb8f51e8a4ea451a45f1f2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2d9d68d136cf9d03a62d1af334cf996f5d9adc14d344228eb9967a0c23b87020de85e2a30518db0c98c5d7a2e57481337dfb82c3358a460463d95fc7d0f8f154090562e2671807f4c5b98f0d1e564d67032129d2b1b450defa549e03ba5fdd7505ea6f3144c4bbc8f9f65b0b05ce074ad479acb52af1d961\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1734d367fe49babc4702760b2bca476d4e7468c1888a71541009d878d70b3327075196485008bc73cf2f809cd5870e91fadf39613161e244a579d72d4a51200c396b7b3488356a414bdcf024db893ff101f17b4af85866264de0c92d0b81e0186694841a45c1830d40f6a0ead59d78ba95802a9e90de68cd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0859d48ef3ee8b83f6affd36ba1dc5625d307a3b2392ab14bc649539a331c774cf4cb51e976757bfd49bfbd71bb49f7c94c659c605959b674753f84383e87f9d4ade222ee1e387c2066a7047b40c80b664bed90c4d79f64426a8d6f1fa1dafd9b7814fb95c00b53dc84524d5a577dd1146a89e37f76f169b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/44282ff2a800a7a56abc4440d5597756e0cc25733d00a764817dadca3e2412b35c1c8e80eea0a5151812d7d9c4e73bd52fef08\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/333d102b0040794a1565f073e354aa572b6f2e61dbd5e8b93079100c1f8ba320419346e64bce80b980553cba8ffbaf9cf5408c9abe31f583c25f71e1c8093a703648f8daf24845859f668dc03aeb63d17be604f7ca77cdf49dbaf631d18ef630d54a7083fb446302b290e912d0123229494b8e1b2fcda502\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e4e79c2c2ca85169eaa1c33662bbffa0f602288e1c9d237a933725477dfd7e88278c37923b603e1aee8dcc95d0ccffcda4414a4a865031adb6f71555cd3692281097f5503602d1600eb2b64b44cabf68a1dfee23c88bf669df9ca4b4f064eceb518e02dacd68a195591c7b5b7fe4fc2905ea7332d93dc60d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/af43c9a8bd0b6a88d489889a4c28dcace9ec0ef564483e428f1a861d235d553c54c66b8f3d1f3441d125501bd79da7a19f8972366491a46b53a0109fd5a900f2dc4ef875f4eca5bb91bfba25aa11129a52860e07a9c6530387662c6f40e22e7c5d449aa8411815de09c76817ba8247177b713a4eab9ab88b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e01a6f50fce9aa7076325f46a4f18f76e23ba3315364dcc55465132694510b072e91b713973a82f14c8a39209fc53c5848feeae38476c3f5b07ee0edcb95488460d42778c8006c761e5e37a4ccff886c1391faf4225fed8ea70c5948e262e056d1c819d607ff77060229311d363a0283a9126e6de34987e7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0bf4ec5e3786bfa7ca79b82572512aed4f8cbd6e948efcd1d4a22e0dec700c63b239ebd1ae4859bd01311337f9bf0295d09d2184b430f29b6000fcaffe1a40f2033b7ca8ee98dc606f390b5d5caa903babbe8870fe9ed177154723680a6f472c885288956b7aa9353056479310357ad658b4dfcc0a1267e3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3f502cd8584d9ec934b8a27def49a5c70022ee3be69c34c25b7c8a29adc78249c3aeefd612f4a6227e73b4f128d998243a7a2ecb5c431046b2fed32a393c656464bc82406c202ba4925102ec64629671e8862e03cc4225c6765babc8e0022d1f059fae3ea913333ee51fd13ef981420fc6b65f34b716a79e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c8f05d1e062cbedda6c6a516df10d8509ff85dc904e3ab08dc69894c29ba2a0a5c54a80102f8848943233b0d67e9930108fa198031c24f4008696a6520452ce5e3f292fefc519f8a51de9714fb2c8ab0ab5982adef847e07372d3e864c59bc884a69bbd614e088f5243ab6144aefd0aa8294d585b4c3d4fd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bf2380ace9b6556309f263e3485ffd0e1299799db1fd2ec8622ea053376f9167581d00a8d90fb1e5a220d196d70573d2a60a1bbd673603bad15b1bb750c26c4c2d61da9806f0c291b24c3e90b48c798704e6dc7e16b094690a65ffb0d70d3d150ecc84b31e2b346f5785a8f48233fe1dd05b65ef44c4aa1e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8417ac42fbf1c2e7c500121950c4d91f0aa5bdf2f90816c379f69812213bf2e6f922f0f43a942804df079c0ad8447e1d725819221068e433132d9141c686029217179484159697b9da5b827e0eccc143a11554efb3931bf9b26003fdeb5d9708e02726ce4827554dbe51ffc0d784ec3ae2c5b54946374daf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5c175a5c44cb25211e48a8e786013fd17a8e92408e3e87f6f6d99e9abb0f8a4589f8a1d3700fee25193f4d989c70bc9dcc30709309017e1c86b8993521aae7a9ebaf265c3ae934d0966f1ab027b51b2f84647ec01480b1801da011a592feca94954be19491bd207f0288f24a7046d9f03c245d2e2f22a9ac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/57414f3183e22453e7df855e8150eed07157dd22573103064202e76763f360435153c79085fbfd2a8bda1e791db4dab78737003f4aa8e206c2b98dafb201592b00b0190f52c7e3da63855be947dcfb3473a6392ef242602c814d301c41b2d0651766d4e9c3515d5386606cb5021f3f46567997777841b804\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8903f4078726d685a350f1ad036a01ea353655374f1872770747d503d1c42299ab22a0ebecbb3e289caf71774cc1640a2fdbcfd260f92383a8548057676b75755f1e1aa55866b7a3196f4bcd755433e728d9b851f267f46c7cc3a4548539cc10a949845f4dadc95eca9f856f406f0fde1e71e3a0e7374f9b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d15e2bbea9f44da626f669da5c6666b4deb442af2c827204013b408fa7cfca453553258b8f8669a26e9e1911a68190febb79e99ff73ed186285aa13b010e1da181c5f9162cc7c0557222c1ed431add621e9fb34f0d956fa49781f59dee8fbf02b6a9a3bdfaba0b3a778fcf9db36e1919d1a0c5bedcc49b9d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1fe59529e4f22bbced946efd64362362b822190b007aec9d34528d0cb9655d084b1d06094a9a8c77010389c99758b436a8fa0e4eccf11a12d0a10ea8d3df6a0631b4233670785db1f986b138c57ee65f705e617371dd3269881a4af1aff6cd58d2abd8b8cd3d786b96cec460543c8725374dba9b4d20f520\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fa4eb725dca5515e817cfe32191350123f156539c17ea83a71549e3e085ad70bd1d636ffd8960fea1565999ea94a201e5bb0067e3804cae5f614a11fcff9ca0d99ed0aac4341a24e21e11655b4606ee24bb83b0a90cb2cdfbfc3a592e721a4b47c7a1ceda6f117da03e5baad8e1e28b4367ab6f1e71e241e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3c47f00192e11cabc2fc21772d9c09d07bbaf7481b9c1f10e014f89178e1e51c2cef3fc3b43ca38e3a0a26992278ac61517f93d61eff9850abf704bb6a29170c0d53478d7f831b3302d7957ff9d3f8cb031892bf7733f25ca678e325610247f25d3784d2ced4a3fff14cf45cd52347cb9194e8d51322100b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5fef138aac6a71efdd839d052a2a2d883b8bba0d3299794fae8496077deda56646fd0d34cd9c9375a2ab4c1faf42d906c8d6696137403d1997f051f7e39e9ac48de0b92d4fb7a792fadd528d4138834bbfb20beca8f131a994d34dd14b6dfa02ffe6a9b5c7dfb9926adefbad4cf0bcd3db2df63564c19b54\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/77a8e8f8f62077b7251d34dd0426f08cb7e79b70234350cc35fc39e3c6389b3c1870066784a171e572541b019dd51e2eb571f71b7c7c860128f55e4eaab3091eaf36aea3643f05a9adc537a8ff0ec28c4a7f7104b40ad183b162ca505aae4731bc4441ba3c0bbaeea1157e52f97461c49e1a7b0e9a83fa1b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8787ee16c320b5652098a91877199767c431370ff28bb90bbc97a2c894c12ba2333dc3a3e1261485157cfad31281f3e141350274ec91897656469b21ba728ac38e5fdb9320f4aa8792750fd7aa746a61be9db8d38bd814b66feac5fd640e069cc040cdb68714a190158d6d02c825610bb633dfd741b67127\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b2a12d22dbeae551df8e2f367145f906afd772df25bed5944e33666e1c28a4ab59babce072a5dfd0cec5dcfa307414db1637005e53d0476d35016befe21781c68e3c9a909e16567c0d5c2faff053a98e115e5cdd9f4bb96f887da3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/71ef1abfcc977e1203f6167547154d634f6a23b92256135b62d1c23b2691ebc3d6aa00ec99f8d31975337c86e91192ebc603a334e706346f138757294f69ab433f522a6613815b4362a29ee8e087a71762f3770f4b9f9849e881ec800488d73420b38691982d8fac41c9fd2f62efc12125e38c04af0a65ab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/87b289da367dc8374b2eb0dba4aee6190093342d5b5182b743dcc339dd899ddadd9e979b61049044540f3459adbd02b193cfab277e74069e8f4b1480583adf2ca4c1ebee728ac1acd152f3d4c0e9c2cb87af1523b2d4a68b87153228530ca0a45f0dbc8c306fa4e7e7c5cae688ed02edb46d5cefa9b074ef\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a2ed5b501353cc537d212be287114e25466a63617a93ccc49e70dc00eff2c6708a5a49be0b015c850510dc4d1af99b785c778548275066489c8c0ad1e9f87a846df6e787412814b1b58ac77630a7f3c0ebc15f7eb05629a94b4b29b65130b8c0da8bc01e1c8d7397665b6db663c917fc6e733ddf8ef76a4f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/aea952ad9534b5687b0fce4b77d436d230198bb73cf8514e9eb418febe7a21ccf1381a7baaaf054786a93c1335f5d5dc19a3ea45887f1fdbaf61099acfdec2dbb91c400b6f27c6b42a087679ee6f2c12ddc4554fbf1083f048c7a29afea74e3e193aad443ebf12443aa62ed432c139c1150af81c42fa9377\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a61f0793fdd32d46860dd748509b344d23b45762bda8a6e4761347035d3916cde5b4e3bc0409bee19dfcea5b9e9a584aa98e1f355314ac280677fb7cfa8fdfb95225ef50552de21f46b8008c6e9e8c37b985cc60f2545a718387624f83b3bb9d2cb024c8b314e884d4b87cbb3e7f52b04a3731985f25e9bf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5905b4b07f1e955bd1c96671966c2e3e8c35fe291bc3dfe9ecf67146a656c01b18f089ce843233254c553b46ea9bd0978b22a95675afa914e6508bd9b71253fda6b2e8081d53ba05ea4169c4ffc7c03aade6003ffb249ef16896e517f7e342eab65b2b32a44520834227406a4dff089a4946b67d0da11cc3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e03b305e0a41a6e4cf0da02054469b634d753f5fdb00edbe49e8189e12ddabe902dbc0cfc81e15070c06be0c7a168869ed16afd5c51436f937c0c1224a86f07fdc9c599b4c79837233c729fd3837e2d42890d3b2f364ea88e1ed80b6882f6f57aa000fdcf568c89efd4951a6ebbdb1db0d2bac47716eac1e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
